  "description": "Drop-in replacement for Sitefinity Feather's ScanControllerContainerAssemblies.ps1\n      build step. The stock script calls Assembly.LoadFrom on every DLL in the bin folder\n      just to read two assembly-level attributes, costing roughly 5 seconds per build.\n      This tool reads the CLI metadata directly instead and produces a byte-identical\n      ControllerContainerAsembliesLocation.json in tens of milliseconds.\n\n      Installing this package overrides the Feather build target automatically. No\n      PowerShell, no .NET runtime dependency - a single self-contained native executable.\n\n      By Steve McNiven-Scott - https://www.sitefinitysteve.com/",
